1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:02,080
Ada satu lagi hadis

2
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:07,840
menarik berkaitan dengan menguap,

3
00:00:08,062 --> 00:00:10,720
iaitu Nabi sendiri.

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,380
Satu hadis riwayat Imam Bukhari

5
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:17,920
dalam kitab beliau, Tarikh Bukhari.

6
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:21,200
Tapi hadisnya hadis

7
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:24,350
mursal.

8
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:31,020
Nabi tak pernah menguap.

9
00:00:31,770 --> 00:00:35,240
Nabi tidak pernah menguap.

10
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:38,945
Ini satu antara kelebihan bagi Nabi

11
00:00:38,945 --> 00:00:41,130
kita Muhammad sallallahu 'alaihi

12
00:00:41,130 --> 00:00:43,520
wasallam, Nabi tidak menguap.

13
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:47,590
Satu lagi keistimewaan

14
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:49,620
Nabi,

15
00:00:50,650 --> 00:00:53,210
pejam mata dia,

16
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:56,580
tapi hati

17
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,880
dia jaga.

18
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:03,660
Maksud Nabi ni, pada Nabi ni

19
00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:04,710
dia jaga.

20
00:01:04,710 --> 00:01:08,120
Mata pejam, hati dia jaga.

21
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:12,830
Itu antara kelebihan untuk pada Nabi.

22
00:01:12,830 --> 00:01:17,500
Nabi kita ya, Nabi tidak menguap.

23
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:19,608
Jadi kalau Nabi tidak menguap,

24
00:01:19,608 --> 00:01:21,840
bererti kalau kita baca hadis tadi,

25
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:24,520
menguap datang daripada syaitan,

26
00:01:24,580 --> 00:01:28,370
bererti Allah Ta'ala menyempitkan

27
00:01:28,370 --> 00:01:32,110
ruang-ruang untuk syaitan mendekati

28
00:01:32,110 --> 00:01:35,140
Nabi kita Muhammad sallallahu

29
00:01:35,150 --> 00:01:35,900
'alaihi wasallam.
